SETEND.EXE (C) PSION PLC 1992

This utility is a DOS utility for correcting errors with Supercalc
spreadsheets which will not load into the Series 3 Spreadsheet, often
giving a end of file error. This is to do with the way that Supercalc
stores it's WK1 files.

The usage is:

SETEND FILE.WK1

This utility can only be used with WK1 files produced by Supercalc.
